    "A card's GIF preview plays when the pointer rests on it, but not while Reduce Motion is on." : {
      "comment" : "Settings › General, under Autoplay preview on hover: what the switch controls. Covers shelf cards and library grid cards; Reduce Motion is the macOS accessibility setting.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die GIF-Vorschau einer Karte wird abgespielt, wenn der Mauszeiger darauf ruht, aber nicht, wenn Reduce Motion aktiviert ist."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A card's GIF preview plays when the pointer rests on it, but not while Reduce Motion is on."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La vista previa GIF de una tarjeta se reproduce al dejar el puntero sobre ella, pero no con Reducir movimiento activado."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La prévisualisation GIF d'une carte s'affiche lorsque le pointeur s'y repose, mais pas lorsque la réduction du mouvement est activée."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "カードにポインタを置くと、その GIF プレビューを再生します。「視差効果を減らす」がオンの間は再生しません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "포인터가 카드 위에 놓여 있을 때 카드의 GIF 미리보기가 재생되지만, 리듀스 모션이 활성화된 상태에서는 재생되지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
