    "Generate your key only at steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey. Never paste a key from a third-party site or installer." : {
      "comment" : "Anti-phishing card body in the API key entry sheet.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Generieren Sie Ihren Schlüssel nur unter steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey. Fügen Sie niemals einen Schlüssel von einer Website oder einem Installer von Drittanbietern ein."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Genera tu clave solo en steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey. Nunca pegues una clave de un sitio o instalador de terceros."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Générez votre clé uniquement sur steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey. Ne collez jamais une clé provenant d'un site ou d'un installateur tiers."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "キーは steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey でのみ生成してください。第三者のサイトやインストーラーから渡されたキーは絶対に貼り付けないでください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Key는 steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey에서만 생성하세요. 제3자 사이트나 설치기에서 키를 복사하여 붙여넣지 마세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
