    "Integrations controls weather location and supported audio response. Enable only the permissions needed by the features you use." : {
      "comment" : "Welcome Tour settings walkthrough or completion.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Integrationen enthält Wetterstandort und unterstützte Audioreaktionen. Aktivieren Sie nur die Berechtigungen für Funktionen, die Sie verwenden."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Integrations controls weather location and supported audio response. Enable only the permissions needed by the features you use."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Integraciones controla la ubicación del tiempo y la respuesta de audio compatible. Activa solo los permisos necesarios para las funciones que uses."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Intégrations regroupe la position météo et la réaction audio prise en charge. N’accordez que les autorisations utiles aux fonctions que vous utilisez."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "連携では、天気の位置情報や対応するオーディオ反応を設定できます。使う機能に必要な権限だけを許可してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "통합 제어는 날씨 위치 및 지원된 오디오 응답을 제어합니다. 사용하는 기능에 필요한 권한만 활성화합니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Os controles de integração permitem a localização do clima e a resposta de áudio suportada. Ative apenas as permissões necessárias pelas funcionalidades que você usa."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统联动管理天气位置和受支持的音频响应。请按所用功能的需要授予权限。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系統聯動管理天氣位置和支援的音訊反應。請依所用功能的需要授予權限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Integrations controls weather location. Enable only the permissions needed by the features you use." : {
