    "macOS can keep registrations from older or moved copies of Loomscreen. Only one copy should provide the system wallpaper." : {
      "comment" : "Subtitle of the extension registration sheet.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS kann Registrierungen älterer oder verschobener Loomscreen-Kopien behalten. Nur eine Kopie sollte den Systemhintergrund bereitstellen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS can keep registrations from older or moved copies of Loomscreen. Only one copy should provide the system wallpaper."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS puede conservar registros de copias antiguas o movidas de Loomscreen. Solo una copia debe proporcionar el fondo del sistema."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS peut conserver les enregistrements de copies anciennes ou déplacées de Loomscreen. Une seule copie doit fournir le fond d’écran système."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS は古いコピーや移動した Loomscreen の登録を残すことがあります。システム壁紙を提供するのは 1 つのコピーだけにしてください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS는 Loomscreen의 오래된 또는 이동된 사본에서 등록을 유지할 수 있습니다. 시스템 배경화면을 제공하는 사본은 하나만 있어야 합니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O macOS pode manter registros de cópias antigas ou movidas do Loomscreen. Apenas uma cópia deve fornecer o papel de parede do sistema."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 可能保留旧版本或移动过的 Loomscreen 副本的注册。系统壁纸只应由一份副本提供。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 可能保留舊版本或移動過的 Loomscreen 副本的註冊。系統桌布只應由一份副本提供。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
