    "On lock, sets enabled displays’ video frames as desktop pictures. These remain after unlock." : {
      "comment" : "Settings explanation; preserve scope and consequences.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Beim Sperren werden Videobilder der dafür aktivierten Monitore als Schreibtischbilder gesetzt. Sie bleiben nach dem Entsperren erhalten."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On lock, sets enabled displays’ video frames as desktop pictures. These remain after unlock."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Al bloquear, usa los fotogramas de vídeo de las pantallas activadas como fondo de pantalla de macOS. Se conservan al desbloquear."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En cas de verrouillage, les images des cadres vidéo des affichages activés sont affichées comme des images d'écran du bureau. Elles restent visibles après déverrouillage."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ロック時に有効なディスプレイの動画フレームを macOS の壁紙に設定し、ロック解除後も保持します。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "잠금 상태에서 설정된 디스플레이의 비디오 프레임을 데스크톱 이미지로 표시합니다. 이는 잠금을 해제한 후에도 유지됩니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ao bloquear, os quadros de vídeo das telas configuradas são exibidos como imagens de desktop. Eles permanecem após o desbloqueio."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "锁屏时将已启用显示器的视频画面设为 macOS 墙纸，解锁后仍会保留。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "鎖定時將已啟用顯示器的影片畫面設為 macOS 背景圖片，解鎖後仍會保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On screen now: %@. Those displays stop playing until you select “%@” again in System Settings › Wallpaper." : {
