    "Open Settings › Workshop › Steam connection and choose Set up SteamCMD. Loomscreen shows the download size and location before installing. Already installed it? Use Locate automatically or Choose SteamCMD." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Öffnen Sie Einstellungen › Workshop › Steam-Verbindung und wählen Sie SteamCMD einrichten. Loomscreen zeigt vor der Installation Download-Größe und Speicherort. Bereits installiert? Nutzen Sie Automatisch lokalisieren oder SteamCMD wählen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Open Settings › Workshop › Steam connection and choose Set up SteamCMD. Loomscreen shows the download size and location before installing. Already installed it? Use Locate automatically or Choose SteamCMD."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Abre Ajustes › Workshop › Conexión de Steam y elige Configurar SteamCMD. Loomscreen muestra el tamaño de la descarga y la ubicación antes de instalar. Si ya lo tienes, usa Localizar automáticamente o Elegir SteamCMD."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ouvrez Réglages › Workshop › Connexion Steam et choisissez Configurer SteamCMD. Loomscreen indique la taille et l’emplacement du téléchargement avant l’installation. Déjà installé ? Utilisez Localiser automatiquement ou Choisir SteamCMD."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "設定 › ワークショップ › Steam 接続を開き、SteamCMD の設定を選びます。Loomscreen はインストール前にダウンロード容量と保存先を表示します。インストール済みなら自動検出または SteamCMD の選択を使います。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "설정 › 창작마당 › Steam 연결에서 SteamCMD 설정을 선택하세요. Loomscreen은 설치 전에 다운로드 크기와 위치를 표시합니다. 이미 설치했다면 자동으로 위치 찾기 또는 SteamCMD 선택을 사용하세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Abra Ajustes › Workshop › Conexão Steam e escolha Configurar SteamCMD. O Loomscreen mostra o tamanho do download e o local antes da instalação. Já está instalado? Use Localizar automaticamente ou Escolher SteamCMD."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开设置 › 创意工坊 › Steam 连接，选择“设置 SteamCMD”。Loomscreen 会在安装前显示下载体积和位置。已经安装？选择“自动查找”或“选择 SteamCMD”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啟設定 › 工作坊 › Steam 連線，選擇「設定 SteamCMD」。Loomscreen 會在安裝前顯示下載大小和位置。已經安裝？選擇「自動尋找」或「選擇 SteamCMD」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
