    "Overlays add independent clocks, weather and widgets above the wallpaper. Switch back with the wallpaper button; the display tabs choose which screen you are editing." : {
      "comment" : "Welcome Tour overlay step in an edition without the music overlay.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Überlagerungen ergänzen unabhängige Uhren, Wetter und Widgets über dem Hintergrund. Die Hintergrund-Schaltfläche führt zurück; die Monitor-Tabs wählen den bearbeiteten Bildschirm."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Overlays add independent clocks, weather and widgets above the wallpaper. Switch back with the wallpaper button; the display tabs choose which screen you are editing."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las superposiciones añaden relojes, tiempo y widgets independientes. Vuelve con el botón de fondo y elige la pantalla con sus pestañas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les superpositions ajoutent des horloges, la météo et des widgets au-dessus du fond. Le bouton du fond d’écran permet de revenir ; les onglets des moniteurs choisissent l’écran à modifier."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "壁紙の上に独立した時計・天気・ウィジェットを追加します。壁紙ボタンで設定に戻り、タブで編集ディスプレイを選びます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "오버레이는 배경화면 위에 독립적인 시계, 날씨 및 위젯을 추가합니다. 배경화면 버튼을 사용하여 다시 전환할 수 있으며, 디스플레이 탭은 편집 중인 화면을 선택합니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "As sobreposições adicionam relógios, clima e widgets independentes acima do papel de parede. Volte com o botão de papel de parede; as guias de exibição selecionam qual tela você está editando."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叠加层在壁纸上方添加独立的时钟、天气和小组件。壁纸按钮可切回配置层，显示器标签选择要编辑的显示器。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "疊加層在桌布上方加入獨立的時鐘、天氣和小工具。桌布按鈕可切回設定層，顯示器標籤選擇要編輯的顯示器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Overlays add independent clocks, weather, music and widgets above the wallpaper. Switch back with the wallpaper button; the display tabs choose which screen you are editing." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Überlagerungen ergänzen unabhängige Uhren, Wetter, Musik und Widgets über dem Hintergrund. Die Hintergrund-Schaltfläche führt zurück; die Monitor-Tabs wählen den bearbeiteten Bildschirm."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Overlays add independent clocks, weather, music and widgets above the wallpaper. Switch back with the wallpaper button; the display tabs choose which screen you are editing."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las superposiciones añaden relojes, tiempo, música y widgets independientes. Vuelve con el botón de fondo y elige la pantalla con sus pestañas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les superpositions ajoutent des horloges indépendantes, la météo, la musique et des widgets au-dessus de l'arrière-plan. Retournez avec le bouton d'arrière-plan ; les onglets d'affichage indiquent l'écran sur lequel vous modifiez."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "壁紙の上に独立した時計・天気・音楽・ウィジェットを追加します。壁紙ボタンで設定に戻り、タブで編集ディスプレイを選びます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "오버레이는 배경화면 위에 독립적인 시계, 날씨, 음악 및 위젯을 추가합니다. 배경화면 버튼을 사용하여 다시 전환할 수 있으며, 디스플레이 탭은 편집 중인 화면을 선택합니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "As sobreposições adicionam relógios, clima, música e widgets independentes acima do papel de parede. Volte com o botão do papel de parede; as abas dos monitores escolhem qual tela editar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叠加层在壁纸上方添加独立的时钟、天气、音乐和小组件。壁纸按钮可切回配置层，显示器标签选择要编辑的显示器。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "疊加層在桌布上方加入獨立的時鐘、天氣、音樂和小工具。桌布按鈕可切回設定層，顯示器標籤選擇要編輯的顯示器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Overlays changes shared widget appearance and units. Arrange individual widgets in each display's overlay editor." : {
      "comment" : "Welcome Tour settings walkthrough or completion.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Überlagerungen enthält gemeinsame Einstellungen für das Aussehen und die Einheiten der Widgets. Einzelne Widgets ordnen Sie im Überlagerungseditor des jeweiligen Monitors an."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Overlays changes shared widget appearance and units. Arrange individual widgets in each display's overlay editor."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Superposiciones cambia la apariencia y las unidades compartidas de los widgets. Organiza cada widget en el editor de superposiciones de su pantalla."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Superpositions règle l’apparence et les unités communes des widgets. Placez chaque widget dans l’éditeur de superpositions de son moniteur."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オーバーレイでは、ウィジェット共通の外観や単位を設定できます。個別の配置は各ディスプレイのオーバーレイエディタで調整してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "오버레이는 공유 위젯의 모양과 단위를 변경합니다. 각 디스플레이의 오버레이 편집기에서 개별 위젯을 정렬합니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "As sobreposições alteram a aparência e as unidades dos widgets compartilhados. Organize os widgets individuais no editor de sobreposição de cada exibição."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叠加层设置管理小组件的共用外观和单位。单个小组件的位置请在各显示器的叠加层编辑器中调整。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "疊加層設定管理小工具的共用外觀和單位。個別小工具的位置請在各顯示器的疊加層編輯器中調整。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
