            "value" : "播放列表與排程"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Playlist plays the wallpapers you add in order or shuffled, by hand or on a timer. Daily Schedule assigns wallpapers to hours of the day. Library Shuffle picks a random wallpaper from your whole library at each interval. Single Wallpaper keeps the current wallpaper and never switches." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wiedergabeliste spielt Ihre Auswahl der Reihe nach oder zufällig ab, manuell oder per Timer. Tageszeitplan ordnet Hintergründe Tageszeiten zu. Die Zufallswiedergabe der Mediathek wählt in jedem Intervall einen Hintergrund aus Ihrer gesamten Mediathek. Einzelner Hintergrund behält die aktuelle Auswahl bei."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Playlist plays the wallpapers you add in order or shuffled, by hand or on a timer. Daily Schedule assigns wallpapers to hours of the day. Library Shuffle picks a random wallpaper from your whole library at each interval. Single Wallpaper keeps the current wallpaper and never switches."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Playlist reproduce los fondos que añadas en orden o en modo aleatorio, a mano o con un temporizador. Programación diaria asigna fondos a las horas del día. Aleatorio de toda la biblioteca elige un fondo al azar de toda tu biblioteca en cada intervalo. Un solo fondo de pantalla conserva el fondo actual y nunca lo cambia."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Liste de lecture lit vos fonds dans l’ordre ou au hasard, manuellement ou avec une minuterie. Programmation quotidienne associe les fonds aux heures de la journée. Lecture aléatoire de la bibliothèque choisit un fond dans toute la bibliothèque à chaque intervalle. Fond d’écran unique conserve le fond actuel."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「プレイリスト」は追加した壁紙を順番またはシャッフルで、手動またはタイマーで切り替えます。「1日のスケジュール」は時間帯ごとに壁紙を割り当てます。「ライブラリ全体をランダム再生」は一定間隔でライブラリ全体から壁紙をランダムに選びます。「単一の壁紙」は現在の壁紙を表示し続け、切り替えません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "재생목록은 추가한 배경화면을 순서대로 또는 무작위로 수동이나 타이머에 따라 재생합니다. 일일 일정은 시간대별 배경화면을 지정합니다. 라이브러리 임의 재생은 매 간격마다 전체 라이브러리에서 무작위로 선택합니다. 단일 배경화면은 현재 배경화면을 유지합니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lista de reprodução toca os papéis adicionados em ordem ou aleatoriamente, por controle manual ou temporizador. Programação diária associa papéis aos horários do dia. Reprodução aleatória da biblioteca escolhe um papel da biblioteca inteira a cada intervalo. Um papel de parede mantém o atual, sem alternar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“播放列表”按顺序或随机播放你添加的壁纸，可手动或按间隔切换。“每日计划”为一天中的各个时段指定壁纸。“壁纸库随机”在每个间隔从整个壁纸库中随机选择一张壁纸。“单张壁纸”保留当前壁纸，从不切换。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「播放列表」依順序或隨機播放你加入的桌布，可手動或依間隔切換。「每日排程」為一天中的各個時段指定桌布。「桌布庫隨機」在每個間隔從整個桌布庫中隨機選擇一張桌布。「單張桌布」保留目前的桌布，從不切換。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Plays in order, then repeats" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spielt der Reihe nach, dann erneut"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Plays in order, then repeats"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reproduce en orden y repite"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lit dans l’ordre, puis recommence"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "順番に再生して繰り返す"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "순서대로 재생한 후 반복"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reproduz em ordem e depois repete"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
