            "value" : "依序播放，播完停止"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Plays once when your wallpapers first appear after launch. With Reduce Motion or Low Power Mode on, it becomes a short fade-in." : {
      "comment" : "Settings › General, info for Opening animation. Reduce Motion is the macOS accessibility setting; Low Power Mode is the macOS battery setting.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wird nach dem Start einmal beim ersten Anzeigen der Hintergründe abgespielt. Bei „Bewegung reduzieren“ oder im Stromsparmodus erscheint stattdessen ein kurzes Einblenden."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Plays once when your wallpapers first appear after launch. With Reduce Motion or Low Power Mode on, it becomes a short fade-in."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se reproduce una vez cuando tus fondos aparecen por primera vez tras abrir la app. Con Reducir movimiento o el modo de bajo consumo activados, pasa a ser un fundido breve."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se joue une fois à la première apparition des fonds d’écran après le démarrage. Avec Réduire les animations ou le mode économie d’énergie, elle devient un bref fondu d’entrée."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "起動後に壁紙が初めて表示されるときに1回だけ再生します。「視差効果を減らす」または低電力モードがオンの間は、短いフェードインになります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "앱 시작 후 배경화면이 처음 표시될 때 한 번 재생됩니다. 동작 줄이기 또는 저전력 모드를 켜면 짧은 페이드인이 적용됩니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "É exibida uma vez quando os papéis de parede aparecem pela primeira vez após abrir o app. Com Reduzir Movimento ou o modo de economia de energia ativado, usa um breve aparecimento gradual."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "启动后第一次显示壁纸时播放一次。开启“减弱动态效果”或低电量模式时，改为短暂的淡入。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "啟動後第一次顯示桌布時播放一次。開啟「減少動態效果」或低耗電模式時，改為短暫的淡入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Plays when a display switches wallpapers, and more slowly when automation switches them. With Reduce Motion or Low Power Mode on, animated transitions become a short crossfade." : {
      "comment" : "Settings › General, info for Wallpaper transition. Reduce Motion is the macOS accessibility setting; Low Power Mode is the macOS battery setting.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wird beim Hintergrundwechsel abgespielt, bei automatischen Wechseln langsamer. Bei „Bewegung reduzieren“ oder im Stromsparmodus wird stattdessen kurz überblendet."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Plays when a display switches wallpapers, and more slowly when automation switches them. With Reduce Motion or Low Power Mode on, animated transitions become a short crossfade."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se reproduce cuando una pantalla cambia de fondo, y más despacio cuando lo cambia la automatización. Con Reducir movimiento o el modo de bajo consumo activados, las transiciones animadas pasan a ser un fundido encadenado breve."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se joue lors d’un changement de fond d’écran, plus lentement pour un changement automatique. Avec Réduire les animations ou le mode économie d’énergie, elle devient un bref fondu enchaîné."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ディスプレイの壁紙が切り替わるときに再生し、自動切り替えのときはゆっくり再生します。「視差効果を減らす」または低電力モードがオンの間は、アニメーションが短いクロスフェードになります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "디스플레이의 배경화면이 바뀔 때 재생되며 자동 전환 시에는 더 느리게 재생됩니다. 동작 줄이기 또는 저전력 모드에서는 애니메이션 대신 짧은 교차 페이드가 적용됩니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "É exibida quando um monitor troca de papel de parede, mais lentamente nas trocas automáticas. Com Reduzir Movimento ou o modo de economia de energia ativado, usa uma breve transição suave."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "显示器切换壁纸时播放，自动轮换时放慢。开启“减弱动态效果”或低电量模式时，动画改为短暂的淡入淡出。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "顯示器切換桌布時播放，自動輪換時放慢。開啟「減少動態效果」或低耗電模式時，動畫改為短暫的淡入淡出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Plugged in" : {
      "comment" : "System overview power status for external AC power.",
