    "Set a wallpaper on a display in Loomscreen. macOS keeps a copy for the desktop and lock screen, and can play it with Loomscreen closed." : {
      "comment" : "System Wallpaper empty state. Copies come from wallpapers set on displays in Loomscreen.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Richten Sie einen Hintergrund für einen Monitor in Loomscreen ein. macOS behält eine Kopie für Schreibtisch und Sperrbildschirm, die auch bei beendetem Loomscreen abgespielt werden kann."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Set a wallpaper on a display in Loomscreen. macOS keeps a copy for the desktop and lock screen, and can play it with Loomscreen closed."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pon un fondo en una pantalla desde Loomscreen. macOS guarda una copia para el escritorio y la pantalla de bloqueo, y puede reproducirla con Loomscreen cerrado."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Définissez une image d'arrière-plan sur un écran dans Loomscreen. macOS conserve une copie pour l'écran de bureau et l'écran de verrouillage, et peut la jouer avec Loomscreen fermé."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen でディスプレイに壁紙を設定してください。macOS がデスクトップとロック画面用にコピーを保存し、Loomscreen を閉じた後も再生できます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen에서 디스플레이에 배경화면을 설정합니다. macOS는 데스크톱과 잠금 화면을 위한 사본을 유지하며, Loomscreen이 닫힌 상태에서 재생할 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Defina um papel de parede em uma tela de exibição em Loomscreen. macOS mantém uma cópia para a tela inicial e a tela de bloqueio, e pode reproduzi-la com Loomscreen fechado."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Loomscreen 中为显示器设置壁纸。macOS 会保存一份副本，用于桌面和锁屏，并可在 Loomscreen 关闭后继续播放。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Loomscreen 中為顯示器設定桌布。macOS 會儲存一份副本，用於桌面與鎖定畫面，並可在 Loomscreen 關閉後繼續播放。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
