            "value" : "Steam 拒絕了已儲存的 API 金鑰。現在以無金鑰方式瀏覽。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam reported \"No Connection\" while downloading this item. Check your network and try again; Steam also answers this way when the account doesn't own Wallpaper Engine." : {
      "comment" : "Workshop download failed: SteamCMD reported No Connection, which is ambiguous between network and ownership.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam meldete während des Herunterladens dieses Artikels \"Keine Verbindung\". Überprüfen Sie Ihr Netzwerk und versuchen Sie es erneut; Steam antwortet auch auf diese Weise, wenn das Konto Wallpaper Engine nicht besitzt."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam respondió \"No Connection\" al descargar este elemento. Comprueba tu red e inténtalo de nuevo; Steam también responde así cuando la cuenta no posee Wallpaper Engine."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam a signalé \"Pas de connexion\" lors du téléchargement de cet article. Vérifiez votre réseau et réessayez ; Steam répond également de cette manière lorsque le compte ne possède pas Wallpaper Engine."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このアイテムのダウンロード中に Steam が \"No Connection\" と応答しました。ネットワークを確認してもう一度お試しください。アカウントが Wallpaper Engine を所有していない場合も、Steam は同じ応答を返します。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam은 이 항목을 다운로드하는 동안 \"연결 없음\"을 보고했습니다. 네트워크를 확인하고 다시 시도하십시오; Steam은 계정이 Wallpaper Engine을 소유하지 않을 때도 이렇게 답변합니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam relatou \"Sem Conexão\" ao baixar este item. Verifique sua rede e tente novamente; Steam também responde dessa maneira quando a conta não possui Wallpaper Engine."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "下载此项目时 Steam 返回了“No Connection”。请检查网络后重试；当账户未拥有 Wallpaper Engine 时，Steam 也会这样回应。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "下載此項目時 Steam 回傳了「No Connection」。請檢查網路後再試一次；當帳戶未擁有 Wallpaper Engine 時，Steam 也會這樣回應。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam reported that it couldn't connect. If you use a VPN or proxy: SteamCMD reaches Steam directly rather than through the system proxy, so try TUN (enhanced) mode or a direct connection." : {
      "comment" : "Steam sign-in failure when SteamCMD reported it could not open a connection to Steam.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam hat berichtet, dass es sich nicht verbinden konnte. Wenn Sie ein VPN oder einen Proxy verwenden: SteamCMD erreicht Steam direkt, anstatt über den System-Proxy, versuchen Sie also den TUN (erweiterten) Modus oder eine direkte Verbindung."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam reported that it couldn't connect. If you use a VPN or proxy: SteamCMD reaches Steam directly rather than through the system proxy, so try TUN (enhanced) mode or a direct connection."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam ha informado de que no ha podido conectar. Si usas una VPN o un proxy: SteamCMD llega a Steam de forma directa, no a través del proxy del sistema, así que prueba el modo TUN (mejorado) o una conexión directa."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam a signalé qu'il ne pouvait pas se connecter. Si vous utilisez un VPN ou un proxy : SteamCMD atteint Steam directement plutôt que via le proxy du système, alors essayez le mode TUN (amélioré) ou une connexion directe."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam が接続できないと報告しました。VPN やプロキシを使用している場合:SteamCMD はシステムプロキシを経由せず Steam に直接接続するため、TUN(拡張)モードか直接接続をお試しください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam에 연결하지 못했습니다. VPN이나 프록시를 사용하는 경우 SteamCMD는 시스템 프록시를 거치지 않고 Steam에 직접 연결합니다. TUN(확장) 모드나 직접 연결을 사용해 보세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam relatou que não conseguiu se conectar. Se você estiver usando uma VPN ou proxy: SteamCMD atinge Steam diretamente em vez de através do proxy do sistema, então tente o modo TUN (aprimorado) ou uma conexão direta."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 报告无法连接。如果你在使用 VPN 或代理：SteamCMD 会直接连接 Steam，不经过系统代理，可以尝试 TUN（增强）模式或直连。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 回報無法連線。如果你在使用 VPN 或代理：SteamCMD 會直接連線 Steam，不經過系統代理，可以嘗試 TUN（增強）模式或直連。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
