          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O diretório raiz de instalação não é o diretório gerenciado SteamCMD."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "安装根目录不是受管理的 SteamCMD 目录。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "安裝根目錄不是受管理的 SteamCMD 目錄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The item menu reveals or removes the macOS copy. Removing a system copy is different from clearing a display's live wallpaper; review the confirmation before removing it." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Artikelmenü zeigt oder entfernt die macOS-Kopie. Das Entfernen einer Systemkopie ist anders als das Löschen des Live-Hintergrundbildes des Displays; überprüfen Sie die Bestätigung, bevor Sie sie entfernen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The item menu reveals or removes the macOS copy. Removing a system copy is different from clearing a display's live wallpaper; review the confirmation before removing it."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El menú permite mostrar o eliminar la copia de macOS. No equivale a quitar el fondo activo de una pantalla; revisa la confirmación."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le menu des éléments révèle ou supprime la copie macOS. La suppression d'une copie système est différente du nettoyage de l'arrière-plan d'écran en direct ; consultez la confirmation avant de la supprimer."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "項目メニューで macOS のコピーを表示・削除できます。ディスプレイのライブ壁紙の解除とは異なるため、削除前に確認文をお読みください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "아이템 메뉴는 macOS 복사본을 표시하거나 제거합니다. 시스템 복사를 제거하는 것은 디스플레이의 라이브 월페어를 지우는 것과 다릅니다; 제거하기 전에 확인을 검토하십시오."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O menu de itens revela ou remove a cópia macOS. Remover uma cópia do sistema é diferente de limpar o papel de parede ao vivo de um display; revise a confirmação antes de removê-la."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "项目菜单可显示或移除 macOS 副本。移除系统副本与清除显示器的动态壁纸不同，请先阅读确认说明。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "項目選單可顯示或移除 macOS 副本。移除系統副本與清除顯示器的動態桌布不同，請先閱讀確認說明。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The key is removed from this Mac. Ratings, authors, and faster search are unavailable until you enter a key again. The key stays active in your Steam account until you revoke it at steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey." : {
      "comment" : "Destructive confirm message for forgetting the stored Steam Web API key.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Schlüssel wird von diesem Mac entfernt. Bewertungen, Autoren und schnellere Suchfunktionen sind nicht verfügbar, bis Sie erneut einen Schlüssel eingeben. Der Schlüssel bleibt in Ihrem Steam-Konto aktiv, bis Sie ihn unter steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey widerrufen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The key is removed from this Mac. Ratings, authors, and faster search are unavailable until you enter a key again. The key stays active in your Steam account until you revoke it at steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La clave se elimina de este Mac. Las valoraciones, los autores y las búsquedas más rápidas no estarán disponibles hasta que vuelvas a introducir una clave. La clave sigue activa en tu cuenta de Steam hasta que la revoques en steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La clé est retirée de ce Mac. Les évaluations, les auteurs et la recherche plus rapide ne sont pas disponibles tant que vous n'entrez pas à nouveau une clé. La clé reste active dans votre compte Steam jusqu'à ce que vous la révoquiez sur steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "キーはこの Mac から削除されます。キーを再入力するまで、評価、作者情報、検索の高速化は利用できません。steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey で取り消すまで、キーは Steam アカウント上で有効なままです。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 Mac에서 키가 제거되었습니다. 다시 키를 입력할 때까지 평점, 저자 및 더 빠른 검색 기능이 사용할 수 없습니다. steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey에서 키를 취소할 때까지 Steam 계정에서 키가 활성 상태로 유지됩니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A chave foi removida deste Mac. Classificações, autores e busca mais rápida não estão disponíveis até que você insira uma nova chave. A chave permanece ativa na sua conta Steam até que você a revogue em steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "密钥将从本机移除。重新输入密钥前，评分、作者和更快的搜索不可用。该密钥在你的 Steam 账户中仍然有效，直至你在 steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey 将其撤销。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "金鑰將從這台 Mac 上移除。重新輸入金鑰前，評分、作者和更快的搜尋無法使用。該金鑰在你的 Steam 帳戶中仍然有效，直到你在 steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey 將其撤銷。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The key is stored in this Mac's keychain and never synced." : {
      "comment" : "Steam Web API key field hint before anything is typed.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Schlüssel wird im Schlüsselbund dieses Mac gespeichert und nie synchronisiert."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La clave se guarda en el llavero de este Mac y nunca se sincroniza."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La clé est stockée dans le Trousseau de ce Mac et n’est jamais synchronisée."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "キーはこの Mac のキーチェーンに保存され、同期されません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "키는 이 Mac의 키체인에 저장되어 있으며 결코 동기화되지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A chave é armazenada no Acesso às Chaves deste Mac e nunca é sincronizada."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "密钥保存在本机的钥匙串里，不会同步。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "金鑰儲存在這台 Mac 的鑰匙圈裡，不會同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
