    },
    "The Web API key is stored in this Mac's login keychain and is never synced. Forgetting it here does not revoke it; do that at steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey." : {
      "comment" : "Workshop privacy statement about where the Web API key lives.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Web-API-Schlüssel wird im Anmeldeschlüsselbund dieses Mac gespeichert und nie synchronisiert. Das Entfernen hier widerruft ihn nicht; widerrufen Sie ihn unter steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La clave de Web API se guarda en el llavero de inicio de sesión de este Mac y nunca se sincroniza. Olvidarla aquí no la revoca; hazlo en steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La clé API Web est stockée dans le trousseau de session de ce Mac et n’est jamais synchronisée. L’oublier ici ne la révoque pas ; vous devez la révoquer sur steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Web API キーはこの Mac のログインキーチェーンに保存され、同期されません。ここで削除しても失効はしません。失効は steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey で行ってください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Web API 키는 이 Mac의 로그인 키체인에 저장되며 동기화되지 않습니다. 여기서 삭제해도 키가 해지되지는 않습니다. 해지하려면 steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey를 방문하세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A chave da Web API é armazenada no Acesso às Chaves de início de sessão deste Mac e nunca é sincronizada. Esquecê-la aqui não a revoga; faça a revogação em steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Web API 密钥保存在本机的登录钥匙串里，不会同步。在这里删除不等于吊销；吊销请到 steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Web API 金鑰儲存在這台 Mac 的登入鑰匙圈裡，不會同步。在這裡刪除不等於撤銷；撤銷請到 steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The web renderer process crashed repeatedly." : {
