    "Use the Steam account that owns Wallpaper Engine. Enter its account name and password, then approve Steam Guard on your phone or enter the requested email or authenticator code. Signing into the Steam app alone does not connect Loomscreen." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Verwenden Sie das Steam-Konto, das Wallpaper Engine besitzt. Geben Sie Kontonamen und Passwort ein. Bestätigen Sie anschließend Steam Guard auf Ihrem Telefon oder geben Sie den angeforderten E-Mail- oder Authenticator-Code ein. Die Anmeldung in der Steam-App allein verbindet Loomscreen nicht."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Use the Steam account that owns Wallpaper Engine. Enter its account name and password, then approve Steam Guard on your phone or enter the requested email or authenticator code. Signing into the Steam app alone does not connect Loomscreen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Usa la cuenta de Steam que posee Wallpaper Engine. Introduce su nombre de cuenta y contraseña, y confirma Steam Guard en el móvil o introduce el código solicitado. Iniciar sesión en la app de Steam no conecta Loomscreen automáticamente."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Utilisez le compte Steam qui possède Wallpaper Engine. Saisissez son nom de compte et son mot de passe, puis approuvez Steam Guard sur votre téléphone ou saisissez le code reçu par e-mail ou fourni par l’authentificateur. La connexion à l’app Steam seule ne connecte pas Loomscreen."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wallpaper Engine を所有する Steam アカウントのアカウント名とパスワードを入力します。続いてスマートフォンで Steam Guard を承認するか、求められたメールまたは認証アプリのコードを入力します。Steam アプリへのログインだけでは Loomscreen は接続されません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wallpaper Engine을 소유한 Steam 계정을 사용하세요. 계정 이름과 비밀번호를 입력한 다음 휴대폰에서 Steam Guard를 승인하거나 요청된 이메일 또는 인증 앱의 코드를 입력하세요. Steam 앱에만 로그인해도 Loomscreen에 연결되는 것은 아닙니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Use a conta Steam que possui Wallpaper Engine. Digite o nome da conta e a senha. Depois, aprove o Steam Guard no celular ou insira o código recebido por e-mail ou gerado pelo autenticador. Entrar apenas no app Steam não conecta o Loomscreen."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用拥有 Wallpaper Engine 的 Steam 账号。输入账号名称和密码，再在手机上确认 Steam Guard，或按提示输入邮件／验证器验证码。仅登录 Steam 应用不会自动连接 Loomscreen。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用擁有 Wallpaper Engine 的 Steam 帳號。輸入帳號名稱和密碼，再在手機上確認 Steam Guard，或依提示輸入郵件／驗證器驗證碼。僅登入 Steam 應用程式不會自動連接 Loomscreen。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use the Steam menu to connect your account, sync subscriptions or add a link. Downloads need SteamCMD and ownership of Wallpaper Engine. Import a Local Folder works without signing in." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Verbinden Sie Ihr Konto im Steam-Menü, synchronisieren Sie Abonnements oder fügen Sie einen Link hinzu. Downloads erfordern SteamCMD und ein Konto mit Wallpaper Engine. „Lokalen Ordner importieren“ funktioniert ohne Anmeldung."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Use the Steam menu to connect your account, sync subscriptions or add a link. Downloads need SteamCMD and ownership of Wallpaper Engine. Import a Local Folder works without signing in."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El menú Steam conecta la cuenta, sincroniza suscripciones o añade enlaces. Descargar requiere SteamCMD y tener Wallpaper Engine. Importar una carpeta local no requiere iniciar sesión."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Utilisez le menu Steam pour connecter votre compte, synchroniser les abonnements ou ajouter un lien. Les téléchargements nécessitent SteamCMD et la propriété de Wallpaper Engine. L'importation d'un dossier local fonctionne sans connexion."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam メニューでアカウント接続・サブスクライブ同期・リンク追加を行います。ダウンロードには SteamCMD と Wallpaper Engine の所有が必要です。ローカルフォルダはサインイン不要です。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 메뉴에서 계정을 연결하거나 구독을 동기화하거나 링크를 추가하세요. 다운로드하려면 SteamCMD와 Wallpaper Engine을 소유한 계정이 필요합니다. 로컬 폴더 가져오기는 로그인 없이 사용할 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Use o menu Steam para conectar sua conta, sincronizar assinaturas ou adicionar um link. Os downloads exigem SteamCMD e propriedade de Wallpaper Engine. A importação de uma Pasta Local funciona sem fazer login."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 菜单可连接账户、同步订阅或添加链接。下载需要 SteamCMD 和 Wallpaper Engine 授权；导入本地文件夹无需登录。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 選單可連接帳號、同步訂閱或加入連結。下載需要 SteamCMD 和 Wallpaper Engine 授權；匯入本機資料夾無需登入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
